# Linear Free-plan / issue-count guard (ALGR)

**Notify the user immediately** (do not silently continue) when Labs Linear usage crosses these thresholds — for **any** site/product/team in the workspace.

## Notify when

| Signal | Threshold | Why |
|--------|-----------|-----|
| **Open issues** (state type not `completed` / `canceled`) | **> 240** workspace-wide | User-set alert before Free-plan pressure / backlog overload |
| **Non-archived issues** (includes Done/Canceled until archived) | **≥ 230** (hard Free cap **250**) | Linear Free: cannot create new issues past 250 non-archived |
| **Teams** | **> 2** on Free (or at paid plan’s team max) | Free allows **2 teams**; creating more fails or forces upgrade |
| **File upload** | **> 10 MB** per file on Free | Free upload size cap (FAB screenshots / attachments) |

Also notify if Linear returns errors that imply plan limits (e.g. cannot create issue / team / upload).

## What to say

Short alert with:

1. Which threshold tripped (open count, non-archived count, teams, upload).
2. Current numbers vs limit.
3. Suggested relief: archive Done/Canceled, close+archive stale, upgrade plan, shrink attachments — **ask before bulk-archiving**.

## When agents must check

- Before creating **many** Linear issues (FAB backfill, bulk import, ticket mill).
- After creating issues if the inbox was already large.
- When a create/team/upload fails with a plan/limit error.
- When the user asks about Linear capacity / Free plan / “how many tickets”.

Helper script (optional): `skills/algr/scripts/linear-plan-guard.mjs` (or run equivalent GraphQL / MCP counts).

## Free-plan reference (Linear pricing)

- Free: **250** non-archived issues, **2** teams, **10 MB** uploads, unlimited members.
- Archived issues do **not** count toward the 250.
- Done/Canceled still count until archived.

## Scope (workspaces)

Linear Free caps are **per workspace**. Labs currently uses more than one:

- **APPtivity Labs** (`linear.app/marley`) — Cursor Apps + any product FAB teams in that workspace
- **GOATkitz** (separate MCP / API key) — GOATkitz team

Check **each** workspace the current site uses. Notify if **any** workspace crosses a threshold (do not average across workspaces).

Helper: `skills/algr/scripts/linear-plan-guard.mjs` with that workspace’s `LINEAR_API_KEY`.

## Do not

- Bulk-archive or delete issues without explicit user approval.
- Ignore create failures that mention issue/team limits.
- Count only one team when the workspace has several — sum **all** teams in that workspace.
